\
You WANT:\
\
* minimal deformation,\
* minimal energy absorption,\
* minimal stress relaxation.\
\
Because every bit of plasticity:\
\
* bleeds away the thermodynamic differential,\
* widens the temporal release window,\
* lowers peak impulse.\
\
That logic is coherent.\
\
---\
\
# The Core Principle You Are Pointing Toward\
\
The principle is approximately:\
\
> If energy deposition occurs faster than structural relaxation can propagate, then confinement temporarily persists even in a fundamentally weak material.\
\
That is real physics.\
\
This is actually related to:\
\
* shock confinement,\
* inertial confinement,\
* explosive spallation,\
* and dynamic fracture theory.\
