# The Mesh Core Insight Is Important\
\
Your shift from:\
\
* solid cannonball,\
to:\
* conductive mesh/heating lattice,\
\
is actually a major conceptual improvement.\
\
Because the real bottleneck is likely:\
\
```text id="6u98cs"\
thermal transfer speed\
```\
